  #|case llhttp request/connection.md:637
  #|name Invalid whitespace token with `Connection` header field (lenient)
  #|side request
  #|wire PUT /url HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: h\r\nConnection : upgrade\r\nContent-Length: 4\r\nUpgrade: ws\r\n\r\nabcdefgh
  #|note Host: h added after the request line
  #|note llhttp mode request-lenient-headers
  #|reason llhttp's lenient mode accepts whitespace between a field name and its colon; mttp refuses it, as RFC 9112 section 5.1 requires of a server (CONTRACT.md "HTTP/1 codec").
  #|expect refused Malformed
  #|upstream request PUT /url 1.1
  #|upstream header host: h
  #|upstream header connection : upgrade
  #|upstream header content-length: 4
  #|upstream header upgrade: ws
  #|upstream body abcd
  #|upstream complete
