  #|note Host: h added after the request line
  #|note llhttp mode request-lenient-transfer-encoding
  #|reason A request target with a fragment is refused: origin-form has none (RFC 9112 section 3.2.1; h1 README "What is refused": an invalid target form). These cases' targets carry `#hey`, so the fragment is refused before the transfer coding the case is about, which is refused too where it is not a single chunked.
